    "text": "GLiNER is a generalist model for named entity recognition created by Urchade Zaratiana. Knowledgator is a key contributor to GLiNER. It supports zero-shot NER, meaning it can recognize any entity type specified at inference time without retraining. GLiNER uses an encoder architecture with span-based NER and label embeddings. It is available on Hugging Face.",
    "metadata": {"source": "seed_data", "topic": "gliner_overview"}
  },
