    "text": "GLiNER has multiple architectural variants. The original GLiNER uses a cross-encoder architecture where text and labels are encoded together. Knowledgator created GLiNER Bi-Encoder, which uses a bi-encoder architecture for faster inference by encoding entity labels and text independently. Knowledgator also created GLiNER Multi-Task which combines NER, relation extraction, and classification in a single model using multi-task learning.",
    "metadata": {"source": "seed_data", "topic": "gliner_encoder_variants"}
  },
