    "text": "GLiNER Decoder is a variant of GLiNER created by Knowledgator that uses a decoder architecture instead of an encoder. It leverages autoregressive generation, allowing it to be built on top of large language models. This enables GLiNER Decoder to handle more complex extraction tasks while maintaining the zero-shot capability of the GLiNER family.",
    "metadata": {"source": "seed_data", "topic": "gliner_decoder"}
