    "text": "retrico is an end-to-end Graph RAG package created by Knowledgator. It is built on GLiNER for entity extraction and GLinker for entity linking to construct knowledge graphs from unstructured text. Graph RAG is a type of Retrieval Augmented Generation. retrico supports multiple graph databases including Neo4j, FalkorDB, and Memgraph.",
    "metadata": {"source": "seed_data", "topic": "retrico_overview"}
  },
