    "text": "retrico provides a multi-strategy query pipeline including entity retrieval, semantic search over embeddings, path reasoning between entities, and a fusion processor that merges results. It supports declarative YAML configuration and a programmatic Builder API for defining pipelines. The DAG pipeline engine executes processors in topological order, and models use lazy loading for efficient memory usage.",
    "metadata": {"source": "seed_data", "topic": "retrico_architecture"}
